	Honolulu\, HI 96815\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nFood/
	Beverage Minimum: $20 per person\nSeating: Communal & First Come\, First S
	erved \nAbout Nate Jackson\nNate Jackson is a viral comedy sensation with 
	over 4.5 million TikTok followers and 700 million global views. In 2025\, 
	he released his first one-hour Netflix special\, Nate Jackson: Super Funny
