	tten\, featuring Pepper Lamb\nIntimate club setting with full bar and dinn
	er menu\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Waikiki\n\nVenue Information\
	nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s premier jazz and comedy club\, located at 
	2335 Kalakaua Ave in the heart of Waikiki. The venue offers a full bar\, d
	inner menu\, and an intimate atmosphere perfect for live performances. \nT
	icket Information\nTickets range from $40.51 – $63.09. A $20 food or bever
	age minimum per person applies. No refunds or exchanges. All sales are fin
