DTSTAMP:20260709T045834Z
DTSTART:20260730T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:BOX OFFICE: 6:00 PM DOORS: 7:00 PM AGES 18+ w/ VALID ID We're c
	ashless! All points of sale will only accept credit\, debit or mobile pay 
	(such as Apple Pay or Google Pay). Will call tickets can be picked up on d
	ay of show at the Box Office. Box Office opens 1 hour prior to door times.
	 You will need a valid photo ID and the credit card used for purchase. ADA
